205565147910", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827960_1270205568481243_3795161829109422694_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=If4v34rBvxoQ7kNvwFuygPn&_nc_oc=AdrfXJ-8XpgNFIVJ8YadlsHbW6ar4N4qCCZwqAoys3t3sJEG2ibli32sjM5U1YvR2vQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzHe_sA0bhVP4SDp2HzXSyMQC8tUJa76NIDJ3cHg8Jkeg&oe=69C3D31C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "f763aa0857754878a1aa0baa4c822193.png", "id": "1887493012186786", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304764_1887493015520119_8852669086761048292_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dHMNoEDSiaMQ7kNvwEb5YIG&_nc_oc=Adpnf-6mS90J6icNLeziGsNNNtn9N-gAW12dVHYvaLe9xilfewzchcA78XGMxZvRbr0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afz5I__I5Tg6D18B8owBgHZkLcG8K0jY9QjHtqGsLxNQeQ&oe=69C3F271"}, "display_name": "Astro Penguin", "keywords": ["platformer", "adventure", "penguin", "astro"], "long_description": "MARS IS MELTING! \nIts icy poles dissolve into vast oceans, and\neerie green light floods the skies.\n\nBraving the unknown, penguin astronauts\nCAPTAIN PEBBLESWORTH and MAJOR BEEKMAN\nembark on a perilous mission to uncover the truth\u2026\n\nAstro Penguin is an experimental, single-player VR platformer. Penguin astronauts have a range of locomotion abilities. They can slide, swim, glide, flap, carve, surf, rocket, grind, (stay tuned for more!). Explore Mars with realistic-feeling movement: feel the wind on your wings.", "short_description": "MARS IS MELTING! \nIts icy poles dissolve into vast oceans, and\neerie green light floods the skies.\n\nBraving the unknown, penguin astronauts\nCAPTAIN PEBBLESWORTH and MAJOR BEEKMAN\nembark on a perilous mission to uncover the truth\u2026\n\nAstro Penguin is a VR platformer. Penguin astronauts have a range of locomotion abilities. They can slide, swim, glide, flap, carve, surf, rocket, grind, (stay tuned for more!). Exp